      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "ELAINA (Wandering Witch) - WAI Illustrious SDXL v17 + Elaina LoRA v1.0 @ 0.9\n\nTrigger word: aaelaina (always include)\nBase character tags: aaelaina, purple eyes, white hair, long hair, single braid, pink hair bow, hair tubes\n\nOutfit tags (pick one):\n- elainawitch: witch hat, white shirt, collared shirt, yellow neck ribbon, black robe, open robe, wide sleeves, brooch, black skirt, pleated skirt\n- elainacasual: ahoge, yellow neck ribbon, white shirt, long sleeves (or sleeveless shirt), black skirt, pleated skirt\n- elainasleep: ahoge, white dress, sleeveless dress, dress ribbon, pink ribbon\n\nTips:\n- Keep 'adult woman, modest proportions' in the positive and 'exaggerated proportions, explicit, genitals, nsfw' in the negative.\n- LoRA works best at 0.9 (model and clip). Lower to 0.7-0.8 if the style fights the checkpoint.\n- Short-hair look: swap 'long hair' for 'short hair' and drop the braid/bow/hair tubes tags.\n- Base: 832x1216, 28 steps, dpmpp_2m karras, CFG 5.5. Hi-res fix: 1.5x bislerp latent upscale, 20 steps, denoise 0.4 (0.35-0.5) -> 1248x1824.\n- Seeds are set to randomize. Change only the scene tags at the end of the positive prompt to make new pictures.\n- Tiled VAE decode keeps VRAM low at the hi-res size."
